id: pm-hxuqsa
title: "GH-912 regression: restore atomic cross-owner seeded Plan creation"
description: "GitHub #912 reports a 2026.8.5 regression of GH-688: plan create persists the Plan before seeded steps hit ownership enforcement, leaving partial state. Restore one-transaction cross-owner seeded creation and retry safety."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags: []
