completed_at: "2026-08-06T07:26:02.866Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 120
acceptance_criteria: Cross-owner plan create with multiple seeded steps commits the complete Plan or nothing; a failed enrichment leaves no item/history residue; safe retry and same-owner behavior are covered.
resolution: fixed
expected_result: "All acceptance criteria are satisfied with local, manual, and hosted evidence."
actual_result: "Cross-owner Plans now create under the author, enrich and transfer ownership within one transaction; regressions, manual proof, exact coverage, and hosted checks pass."
